Package: HDF5DataFrame
Version: 0.99.3
Date: 2026-01-20
Title: HDF5-backed DataFrame objects and methods
Description: 
    HDF5DataFrame is an R/Bioconductor package for HDF5-backed DataFrame objects 
    and methods. This allows HDF5-backed data to be easily used as data frames 
    with arbitrary sets of columns.
